OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACommons portrait display 'a
OL,4,Acelebration of women'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey portrait artist says having
OL,7,Fher portraits of women including
OL,8,FNazanin Zaghari-Ratcliffe and Dame
OL,9,FMaggie Aderin shown in the House of
OL,10,FCommons is "a celebration of them".
OL,12,FCaroline De Peyrecave said seeing her
OL,13,Fwork in the Upper Waiting Hall in the
OL,14,FHouses of Parliament "felt like another
OL,15,Fextraordinary moment in their journey"
OL,16,Fas they remain on display this week.
OL,18,FDe Peyrecave's works, created in her
OL,19,Fstudio in Westcott near Dorking, are
OL,20,Fpart of a series of oil portraits
OL,21,Fcelebrating British women in culture,
OL,22,Fsports, science and public life.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
